<section class="band" aria-labelledby="one-rule">
  <div class="split">
    <div class="split-head"><h2 id="one-rule">The one rule</h2></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Never act on contact you didn't start. If a message, call or email asks for money, a code, a password or access to your device, stop and contact the organisation yourself using its app, a website you type in, or the number on your card.</p>
      <p>Forward scam texts to <strong>7726</strong>. Report scams to Netsafe on <strong>0508 638 723</strong> and cyber incidents to the National Cyber Security Centre on <strong>0800 114 115</strong>.</p>
      <p>For the patterns behind every scam, read <a href="/guides/people/scams/">how scams work on New Zealanders</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
